    "description": "Jp-Holdings,Inc. provides childcare support services in Japan. The company is involved in the operation of child-rearing support facilities, such as nursery schools, after-school clubs, and children's centers, as well as community centers; and development and provision of programs comprising English, gymnastics, music, eurhythmics, and early childhood learning programs. It also engages in the provision of meals for child-rearing support facilities, and advisory services regarding meals; conduction of training and research on childcare and child development; and planning and sale of childcare-related products, such as toy shelves and picture bookshelves. In addition, it operates Kodomel, a child-rearing support platform; engages in consignment of food service; provides contract training for child development to corporations and local governments; and manages real estate. Further, the company is involved in food education activities such as school lunches, cooking classes, and food and agriculture. Additionally, it provides property leasing, property management, and real estate consulting related to childcare support operations; Temporary staffing service, employment placement, introduction of non-Japanese personnel with skills and non-Japanese technical intern trainees; and ALT (Assistant Language Teacher). Jp-Holdings,Inc. was incorporated in 1993 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan."
